meta {
  name: Notifications - Count
  type: http
  seq: 148
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/notifications/count
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The number that the bell shows (#1474): the notifications that you did not see, 14 days old at most, after the access check (`data.count`). The client shows 1 to 9, then 9+, and nothing at zero. `data.messages` is the number of conversations with new messages, in every community, for the title of the browser tab (#1476). Needs notifications:read.
}
